MID_LGV_XXX_Ism_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Ism_Closed_m01_001: I don't think I need to go that way.
MID_LGV_XXX_Kai_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Kai_Closed_m01_001: I don't need to go this way now.
MID_LGV_XXX_Dit_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Dit_Closed_m01_001: My path lies elsewhere.
MID_LGV_XXX_Seo_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Seo_Closed_m01_001: I see no need to go there.
MID_LGV_XXX_Led_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Led_Closed_m01_001: This seems like the wrong direction.
MID_LGV_XXX_Bel_Closed_m01: 
MID_LGV_XXX_Bel_Closed_m01_001: 
MID_LGV_XXX_Tal_Closed_m01: 
MID_LGV_XXX_Tal_Closed_m01_001: 
MID_LGV_XXX_Orh_Closed_m01: 
MID_LGV_XXX_Orh_Closed_m01_001: 
MID_LGV_XXX_Anh_Closed_m01: 
MID_LGV_XXX_Anh_Closed_m01_001: 
MID_LGV_XXX_Gatekeeper_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Gatekeeper_Closed_m01_001: You're not allowed past here.
MID_LGA_XXX_Gatekeeper_Closed_m01: <BLN>This is as far as you go.
MID_LGV_XXX_EXDungeon_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_EXDungeon_Closed_m01_001: <DLG>The door remains silent, not reacting to you at all.
MID_LGV_1XXX_TGXX_106_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1XXX_TGXX_106_m01_001: Hey! You there! This area is off limits.
MID_LGV_1XXX_TGXX_106_m01_002: Sorry, but we're still cleaning up after an incident\nwith some unruly patrons at the bar.
MID_LGV_XXX_Gatekeeper_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Gatekeeper_m02_001: You like breathing? Then get out of my face before\nI break yours.
MID_LGA_XXX_Gatekeeper_m02: <BLN>Shove off.
MID_LGV_XXX_Gatekeeper_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Gatekeeper_m03_001: Are you some kind of moron? I told you to get out\nof here!
MID_LGV_XXX_Gatekeeper_m03_002: And if I catch you around again, we're gonna\nhave problems.
MID_LGV_XXX_Hur_Arena_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Hur_Arena_m02_001: Today's match day. Good luck!
MID_LGA_XXX_Hur_Arena_m02: <BLN>Today's match day.
MID_LGV_XXX_Arena_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Arena_m01_001: Your match will take place on {SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=Month} {DateTime=Day}{SetColor=Default}.\nPlease come back on the appointed day.
MID_LGA_XXX_Arena_m01: <BLN>The next match is...
MID_LGV_XXX_Arena_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Arena_m02_001: Your match is today. Are you ready?
MID_LGA_XXX_Arena_m02: <BLN>Your match is today.
MID_LGV_XXX_Arena_Final_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Arena_Final_m01_001: The final match will take place on {SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=Month} {DateTime=Day}{SetColor=Default}.\nPlease come back on the appointed day.
MID_LGA_XXX_Arena_Final_m01: <BLN>The next match is...
MID_LGV_XXX_Arena_Final_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Arena_Final_m02_001: It's here at last...the day of the final match.\nAre you ready?
MID_LGA_XXX_Arena_Final_m02: <BLN>The final match at last...
MID_LGV_XXX_Arena_Watching_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Arena_Watching_m01_001: Today's match is over, but there'll be others to\nwatch later.
MID_LGV_XXX_Elevator_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Elevator_m01_001: Do you want to use the water lift?
MID_LGV_XXX_Elevator_m01_002: <ICA>Say yes.
MID_LGV_XXX_Elevator_m01_003: <ICB>Say no.
MID_LGA_XXX_Elevator_U_m01: <BLN>This goes to the docks.
MID_LGA_XXX_Elevator_D_m01: <BLN>This goes to the arena.
MID_LGV_XXX_Elevator_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Elevator_Closed_m001_001: You can't use the water lift. It's undergoing\ninspection right now.
MID_LGA_XXX_Elevator_Closed_m01: <BLN>No water lift right now.
MID_LGV_XXX_Departure_m01: 
MID_LGV_XXX_Departure_m01_001: 
MID_LGV_XXX_Departure_m01_002: 
MID_LGV_XXX_Departure_m01_003: 
MID_LGV_XXX_Gatekeeper_m01: <TH>
MID_LGA_XXX_Gatekeeper_m01: The gate's closed right now.
MID_LGV_XXX_BirdFollow_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_BirdFollow_m01_001: I see you took my advice and adopted the form of\na bird to watch over them.
MID_LGV_XXX_BirdFollow_m01_002: And not only that...you've somehow formed an\nemotional bond with them that way?!
MID_LGV_XXX_BirdFollow_m01_003: They should have no inkling of your true nature,\nbut I suppose stranger things have happened.
MID_LGV_XXX_BirdFollow_m01_004: Best to simply accept the bizarre miracle of the ties\nyou've managed to forge.
MID_LGA_XXX_BirdFollow_m01: <BLN>What in the world...
MID_LGV_XXX_JuFasTemple_Closed_m01: 
MID_LGV_XXX_JuFasTemple_Closed_m01_001: 
MID_LGV_1KAI_A60Lock_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_A60Lock_m01_001: It's locked. I think it can be unlocked from the\nother side.
MID_LGV_1KAI_A60Lock_m01_002: But is there a way to get over there?
MID_LGV_1KAI_A60Open_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_A60Open_m01_001: OK, that's open. Now we can go through here\nany time we want.
MID_LGV_1KAI_A100Warp_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_A100Warp_m01_001: Would you like to see Aurora?
MID_LGV_1KAI_A100Warp_m01_002: <ICA>Say yes.
MID_LGV_1KAI_A100Warp_m01_003: <ICB>Say no.
