MID_LGV_3ISM_Obelisk_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_Obelisk_m01_001: Oh? Would you like to return to the\nObelisk Chamber?
MID_LGV_3ISM_Obelisk_m01_002: <ICA>"Yes."
MID_LGV_3ISM_Obelisk_m01_003: <ICB>"No."
MID_LGV_3ISM_Obelisk_m01_004: <ACA>Very well. Come with me.
MID_LGV_3ISM_Obelisk_m01_005: <ACB>Ah. Well, if you ever do want to go back, simply\nsay the word.
MID_LGV_3ISM_CrownKey_FirstGet_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_CrownKey_FirstGet_m01_001: What is this key? I can tell it's ancient, but more than\nthat is frustratingly elusive.
MID_LGV_3ISM_CrownKey_FirstGet_m01_002: Let me look into it deeper. Take good care not to\nlose the thing!
MID_LGV_3ISM_CrownKey_FirstGet_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_CrownKey_FirstGet_m02_001: What you have there is the key to a room inside the\ntemple of the Diadem.
MID_LGV_3ISM_CrownKey_FirstGet_m02_002: If we go there and unlock it, I'm certain we'll be\njustly rewarded!
MID_LGV_3ISM_PromptObelisk_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_PromptObelisk_m01_001: If you feel that your forces are insufficient, you can\nalways return to the Obelisk Chamber.
MID_LGV_3ISM_PromptObelisk_m01_002: Meddling with causality to form bonds with the other\nFlame Lords is a good way to shore up your army.
MID_LGA_3ISM_PromptObelisk_m01: <BLN>Do you have enough forces?
MID_LGV_3ISM_RouteComplete_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3ISM_RouteComplete_m01_001: You've mastered causality enough to draw a great\nmany warriors to you here and now.
MID_LGV_3ISM_RouteComplete_m01_002: You know what we are facing, and we can certainly\nnot let our guard down...but this is impressive.
MID_LGA_3ISM_RouteComplete_m01: <BLN>You've gathered many warriors.
LGV_XXX_Notice_Unlock_Guide: <TH>
LGV_XXX_Notice_Unlock_Guide_001: <DLG>The Adventure Guide has been added to the Adventure Journal.\nCheck it out if you're not sure what to do with your free time.
LGV_XXX_Notice_Unlock_Honor: <TH>
LGV_XXX_Notice_Unlock_Honor_001: <DLG>Renown Perks have been added to the Adventure Journal.\nThese let you know what your increased renown will earn you.
LGV_XXX_Notice_Unlock_Quest: <TH>
LGV_XXX_Notice_Unlock_Quest_001: <DLG>The Quest List has been added to the Adventure Journal.\nFrom here, you can review the quests you've accepted.
LGV_XXX_Notice_Unlock_Calendar: <TH>
LGV_XXX_Notice_Unlock_Calendar_001: <DLG>The Calendar has been added to the Adventure Journal.\nUse it to make the most of your free time.
LGV_XXX_Notice_Unlock_BattleHint: <TH>
LGV_XXX_Notice_Unlock_BattleHint_001: <DLG>Foresight has been added to the Adventure Journal.\nHere, you'll find information on the next main quest battle.